442 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Starting from the denormalized FullVehicle relation, we identified the functional dependencies and candidate keys, removed partial dependencies to reach 2NF by creating Company, VehicleType, and VehicleModel tables, and eliminated transitive dependencies to reach 3NF \(and BCNF under the given FDs\). The final relations \(Company, VehicleType, VehicleModel, Vehicle, Employee, Maintenance, Insurance\) minimize redundancy and prevent insertion/update/delete anomalies while preserving all original information via foreign keys.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
